  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: MP-1002: you start its worker
  s0 --> s2: MP-1001: you start its worker
  s1 --> s3: MP-1002: its worker edits in its worktree
  s2 --> s4: MP-1001: its worker dies (model quota)
  s3 --> s5: your turn ends: no notice
  s3 --> s7: MP-1002's worker returns, its check passed: the book does not count it
