  s5 --> s7: MP-1002's worker returns, its check passed: the book does not count it
  s7 --> s8: your turn ends: the notice asks MP-1001 for act
  s8 --> s8: a todo is added or completed
  s8 --> s7: someone else starts your turn
  s7 --> s9: MP-1002: you run its anchor: it passes
  s9 --> s10: your turn ends: the notice asks MP-1001 for act
